  <section>
    <h2>The proof problem</h2>
    <p>Why the degree stopped working as a job ticket, and what that means for you.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/learn/what-makes-fresh-graduates-unhireable-and-how-do-you-fix-it">What makes fresh graduates unhireable, and how do you fix it?</a> <span class="mono-label">PILLAR</span></li>
      <li><a href="/learn/do-you-need-a-perfect-gpa-to-get-hired">Do you need a perfect GPA to get hired?</a></li>
